{"comment_text": {"ja38:0.1": "", "ja38:0.2": "", "ja38:0.3": "", "ja38:0.4": "", "ja38:1.1": "The crane, appearing to contemplate deeply as it waits beside the pond, catches the fish by means of fraud, but is outplayed by the canny crab. ", "ja38:1.2": "", "ja38:1.3": "", "ja38:1.4": "", "ja38:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja38:0.1": "<article id='ja38'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja38:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja38:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja38:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja38:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja38:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja38:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja38:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja38:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja38:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja38:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja38:0.3": "Kulāvakavagga ", "ja38:0.4": "8. Bakajātaka ", "ja38:1.1": "“Nāccantaṁ nikatippañño, ", "ja38:1.2": "nikatyā sukhamedhati; ", "ja38:1.3": "Ārādheti nikatippañño, ", "ja38:1.4": "bako kakkaṭakāmivā”ti. ", "ja38:2.1": "Bakajātakaṁ aṭṭhamaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja38:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 38 ", "ja38:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja38:0.3": "Nests ", "ja38:0.4": "The Crane: a past life story ", "ja38:1.1": "The clever cheat cannot achieve ", "ja38:1.2": "ultimate happiness by cheating. ", "ja38:1.3": "The clever cheat succeeds only ", "ja38:1.4": "in getting what the crane did from the crab. ", "ja38:2.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja38:0.1": "", "ja38:0.2": "", "ja38:0.3": "", "ja38:0.4": "", "ja38:1.1": "", "ja38:1.2": "", "ja38:1.3": "Ārādheti nikatippañño → ārādhe nikatippañño (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja38:1.4": "", "ja38:2.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja38:0.1": "", "ja38:0.2": "", "ja38:0.3": "", "ja38:0.4": "", "ja38:1.1": "dr27.14, ms22J_82, msdiv38, ndp22.11, pts-vp-pli1.223, sya27.13", "ja38:1.2": "", "ja38:1.3": "", "ja38:1.4": "", "ja38:2.1": "ms22J_83"}, "keys_order": ["ja38:0.1", 